(text "Miata ECU motherboard 2001-2005 (NB2, VVT). Carries the year-specific harness header and the year-independent I/O (wideband, MAP, IAT, USB-C). All engine control is on the daughterboard." (at 30.48 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 313b1f6a-65f2-4e8d-a348-10fe35b2405b)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))